    "name": "FRED Maps API (GeoFRED) Categories Regional Data API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "GeoFRED (the FRED Maps API) exposes geographic / regional views of FRED economic data. Series-group metadata, regional-data lookups across geographies (state, county, MSA, country, census tract, etc.), and GeoJSON shape files for cartographic rendering of FRED indicators.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis — Research Division",
